# "Your next turn" waits for the first turn that isn't skipped (CR 614.10a). Bot1 casts Time Vault on turn 1 (declining
# its skip at turn 3) and Kav Landseeker on turn 3, then skips turn 5 with the Vault: that turn was never taken, the
# delayed ability waits on, and Bot1's next turn is turn 6, at whose end step the Lander is sacrificed.
